  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-294-308">冷たさよ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-308-333">わが身をつゝめ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-333-368">わが書齋の窓より見ゆる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-368-403">遠き岡、岡のうへの木立</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-403-412">一帶に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412-427"><rb>黝</rb><rt>くろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-427-441">み靜もり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-441-470">岡を掩ひ木立を照し</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-470-499">わが窓さきにそゝぐ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-499-536">夏の日の光に冷たさあれ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-536-556">わが凭る椅子</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-556-571">腕を投げし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-571-595"><rb>卓子</rb><rt>てーぶる</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-597-623">脚重くとどける疊</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-623-658">部屋をこめて動かぬ空氣</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-658-698">すべてみな氷のごとくなれ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-698-730">わがまなこ冷かに澄み</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-730-765">あるとなきおもひを湛へ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-765-794">勞れはてしこゝろは</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-794-808">森の奧に</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-808-845">古びたる池の如くにあれ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-845-862">あゝねがふ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-862-888">わが日の安らかさ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-888-911">わが日の靜けさ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-911-935">わが日の冷たさを</seg></p>
    </body>
